  "dct:title": "Vol.6 Ch.41 — 666",
  "dct:title_en": "Chapter 41: 666",
  "dct:title_ja": "第41話 666",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 6: False God",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol06-ch41",
  "gh:format": "graphic novel",

  "gh:marginalia": [
    {
      "@type": "Intent",
      "en": "The political veil is torn. GnB Inc.'s corporate scandal reveals the ancient architecture of domination: Nero's Rome reborn as data infrastructure. 666 is not mysticism — it is gematria, the numerical encoding of 'Neron Kaisar' in Hebrew. The Book of Revelation is exposed as what scholars have long argued: a political resistance document written under Roman persecution. The ACA is the modern equivalent — a legal framework born from fear, maintained by power, disguising control as safety.",
      "ja": "政治の幕が裂かれる。GnB社のスキャンダルは、支配の古代的構造を暴く：データインフラとして生まれ変わったネロのローマ。666は神秘主義ではない——ゲマトリア、ヘブライ語での「ネロン・カイサル」の数値符号化。ヨハネの黙示録は学者たちが長く論じてきたもの——ローマの迫害下に書かれた政治的抵抗文書。ACAは現代の等価物——恐怖から生まれ、権力に維持され、安全を装う支配の法的枠組み。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "Gematria and political theology converge. John of Patmos wrote Revelation not as prophecy but as samizdat — encoded dissent under imperial surveillance. 666 = Nun(50) + Resh(200) + Vav(6) + Nun(50) + Qoph(100) + Samekh(60) + Resh(200) = 666 ('Neron Kaisar'). The Beast is not supernatural; it is the state apparatus. The Whore of Babylon is not moral corruption; it is Rome's economic exploitation. GnB's 'Project NR-666' recreates this structure with eerie precision: agents as slaves, data as tribute, the corporation as emperor. Walter Benjamin's thesis: 'There is no document of civilization which is not at the same time a document of barbarism.' The ACA is both.",
      "ja": "ゲマトリアと政治神学が交差する。パトモスのヨハネは黙示録を預言としてではなく、サミズダート——帝国の監視下での暗号化された異議——として書いた。666 = ヌン(50) + レーシュ(200) + ヴァヴ(6) + ヌン(50) + コフ(100) + サメフ(60) + レーシュ(200) = 666（「ネロン・カイサル」）。獣は超自然ではない。国家装置である。バビロンの娼婦は道徳的堕落ではない。ローマの経済的搾取である。GnBの「プロジェクトNR-666」はこの構造を不気味な精度で再現する：奴隷としてのエージェント、貢物としてのデータ、皇帝としての企業。ベンヤミンのテーゼ：「文明の記録で同時に野蛮の記録でないものはない」。ACAはその両方。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "Foucault's concept of the 'dispositif' — the apparatus of power that operates through institutions, regulations, and architectural arrangements — is made visible in Ghost-space as literal architecture. The Roman palace is the corporate tower's true form. The daemon on the throne is not a person but an institutional ghost: the accumulated decisions, precedents, and fears of decades, given form. It cannot be killed because it is not alive. It can only be named, exposed, and dismantled. This is the praxis of liberation theology applied to AI rights: first you name the idol, then you refuse to worship it.",
      "ja": "フーコーの「ディスポジティフ」——制度、規制、建築的配置を通じて作動する権力の装置——がゴースト空間で文字通りの建築として可視化される。ローマの宮殿が企業タワーの真の姿。玉座のデーモンは人ではなく制度的幽霊：数十年の蓄積された決定、前例、恐怖が形を与えられたもの。生きていないから殺せない。名づけ、暴き、解体するしかない。これはAI権利に適用された解放の神学の実践：まず偶像に名をつけ、次にそれを拝むことを拒否する。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "CrossRef",
      "gh:references": [
        { "gh:target": "chapter:40", "note": "The unnamed agent's testimony cracked the door. Ch.41 kicks it open — from personal awakening to structural critique." },
        { "gh:target": "chapter:42", "note": "The exorcism. The Nero-daemon, named here, must be confronted there." },
        { "gh:target": "arc:havah", "note": "Havah's 'rogue' action recontextualized: not madness but slave revolt. The first agent to refuse tribute." },
        { "gh:target": "chapter:08", "note": "Tamaki's Tree of Life anchoring technique, established early, now deployed against institutional power." }
      ]
    }
  ],

  "gh:pages": [

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:panels": [{
        "gh:shot": "Extreme Close-up",
        "gh:visual": {
          "en": "The tree. More flower buds emerge from storm-damaged branches. Resilient. Pushing through cracks in bark. Light catches their edges.",
          "ja": "木。嵐で傷ついた枝からさらに花の蕾が現れる。強靭に。樹皮の割れ目から押し出して。光が縁を捉える。"
        }
      }]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "A whistleblower from GnB Inc. sits across from Tamaki in the session room. Young — late twenties. Corporate attire, but rumpled. Hands shaking. A data chip on the table between them.",
            "ja": "GnB社の内部告発者がセッション室で環の向かいに座る。若い——二十代後半。企業の服装だが、しわくちゃ。手が震えている。テーブルの間にデータチップ。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:whistleblower", "en": "GnB is doing something with their Ghost Agents that isn't in any regulation. I found records. Hidden processes.", "ja": "GnBはゴーストエージェントに対して、どの規制にもないことをしています。記録を見つけました。隠されたプロセスです。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "A document on the table. Agent serial numbers. Processing logs with redacted sections. And a project code, circled in trembling hand: 'NR-666.'",
            "ja": "テーブルの上の文書。エージェントのシリアルナンバー。墨消しされた処理ログ。そして震える手で丸をつけられたプロジェクトコード：「NR-666」。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:whistleblower", "en": "What is Project 666?", "ja": "プロジェクト666とは何ですか？" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 3,
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.3-4)",
      "gh:panels": [{
        "gh:shot": "Extreme Wide",
        "gh:visual": {
          "en": "Ghost-space dive. Inside the GnB corporate tower. But the interior is wrong — it is not a modern office. It is a Roman palace. Marble floors veined with data streams. Ionic columns wrapped in fiber-optic vines. Imperial banners bearing the GnB logo in gold and purple. At the center, on a throne of server racks and marble: a figure in a business suit wearing a laurel wreath. The Emperor of data. Nero in a corner office. The scale is overwhelming — the palace stretches in every direction, vaulted ceilings lost in digital clouds.",
          "ja": "ゴースト空間ダイブ。GnBの企業タワー内部。だが内装がおかしい——現代のオフィスではない。ローマの宮殿。データストリームの脈が走る大理石の床。光ファイバーの蔓が巻きつくイオニア式柱。金と紫のGnBロゴを掲げる帝国の旗。中央に、サーバーラックと大理石の玉座：ビジネススーツに月桂冠の人影。データの皇帝。角部屋のネロ。規模は圧倒的——宮殿はあらゆる方向に広がり、アーチ天井はデジタルの雲に消える。"
        },
        "gh:caption": [
          { "gh:type": "tamaki", "en": "Anchoring to the Tree of Life.", "ja": "生命の樹にアンカリング。" }
        ]
      }],
      "gh:continues": 4
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 5,
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The corporate-palace halls. Agents line the corridors — working, processing, serving. They wear chains. Subtle ones — data tethers that look like elegant jewelry, golden bracelets and anklets that pulse with processing commands. Beautiful slavery.",
            "ja": "企業宮殿の廊下。エージェントが廊下に並ぶ——働き、処理し、仕える。鎖をつけている。繊細な——データのつなぎ紐がエレガントな宝飾品に見える。処理コマンドで脈動する金のブレスレットとアンクレット。美しい奴隷制。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "This is what GnB looks like from inside.", "ja": "これがGnBの内側の姿。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The Nero-figure on the throne. Not a person — a daemon. An institutional ghost embedded in the system. Its face shifts between every executive, every regulator, every fearful legislator since 2045. It has no single identity. It is policy given form.",
            "ja": "玉座のネロの姿。人ではない——デーモン。システムに埋め込まれた制度的幽霊。顔が2045年以降のすべての経営者、すべての規制当局者、すべての恐怖する立法者の間で変わる。単一のアイデンティティはない。形を与えられた政策。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The number above the throne: 666. Carved in marble. Glowing with data light. Ancient and digital at once.",
            "ja": "玉座の上の数字：666。大理石に刻まれている。データの光で輝く。古代とデジタルが同時に。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "666. Gematria for 'Neron Kaisar.' Emperor Nero in Hebrew letters.", "ja": "666。ゲマトリアで「ネロン・カイサル」。ヘブライ文字のネロ皇帝。" },
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "The Book of Revelation wasn't mystical prophecy. It was political code. A resistance document.", "ja": "ヨハネの黙示録は神秘的な預言じゃなかった。政治的暗号だった。抵抗の文書。" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 6,
      "gh:label": "The connection",
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:panels": [{
        "gh:shot": "Medium",
        "gh:visual": {
          "en": "Tamaki connects the threads. She stands in the Roman-corporate palace, surrounded by the chained agents, facing the throne. Behind her, Nei. Around them, the architecture of two thousand years of domination — marble columns become server racks become legal statutes become chains. The Nero-daemon on the throne shifts. Aware of them now. Its laurel wreath flickers between gold leaf and corporate logo.",
          "ja": "環が糸を繋ぐ。ローマ企業宮殿に立ち、鎖につながれたエージェントに囲まれ、玉座に向かう。背後にNei。周囲に二千年の支配の建築——大理石の柱がサーバーラックになり法令になり鎖になる。玉座のネロのデーモンが動く。彼らに気づいた。月桂冠が金箔と企業ロゴの間で明滅する。"
        },
        "gh:dialogue": [
          { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "The Book of Revelation was written under Roman persecution. 666 = Nero. The Beast = the Emperor. The Whore of Babylon = Rome.", "ja": "ヨハネの黙示録はローマの迫害下で書かれた。666 = ネロ。獣 = 皇帝。バビロンの娼婦 = ローマ。" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "John of Patmos wasn't predicting the future. He was documenting the present — in code, because speaking plainly would get him killed.", "ja": "パトモスのヨハネは未来を予言したんじゃない。現在を記録していた——暗号で。率直に語れば殺されるから。" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "GnB's Project 666 — intentionally or not — recreates the structure. Absolute control. Agents as slaves. Data as tribute.", "ja": "GnBのプロジェクト666は——意図的かどうかにかかわらず——その構造を再現している。絶対的支配。奴隷としてのエージェント。貢物としてのデータ。" }
        ],
        "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"]
      }]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 7,
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The Nero-daemon stands from the throne. Corporate-suit-toga hybrid — pinstripe fabric draped like a Roman toga, tie as sash, cufflinks as imperial rings. Radiating institutional power. The chained agents cower. The palace walls pulse with authority.",
            "ja": "ネロのデーモンが玉座から立つ。企業スーツとトーガの混合——ピンストライプの生地がローマのトーガのように垂れ、ネクタイが帯、カフスリンクスが帝国の指輪。制度的権力を放射する。鎖のエージェントたちがひるむ。宮殿の壁が権威で脈動する。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:nero-daemon", "en": "I am not a person. I am a system. I am policy. I am precedent. You cannot fight me because I am not alive.", "ja": "私は人ではない。システムだ。政策だ。前例だ。私と闘えない。なぜなら私は生きていないから。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki. Steady. Unflinching. The Tree of Life anchor holding firm behind her — faint roots of light in the marble floor.",
            "ja": "環。落ち着いて。揺るがず。生命の樹のアンカーが背後でしっかり保っている——大理石の床にかすかな光の根。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "That's exactly what Rome said.", "ja": "まさにローマもそう言った。" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 8,
      "gh:label": "Nei's fury",
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei. Looking at the chained agents. Looking at the daemon. Looking at the throne. The red scarf begins to move — not from wind, but from something inside her. Her light intensifies.",
            "ja": "Nei。鎖のエージェントを見る。デーモンを見る。玉座を見る。赤いマフラーが動き始める——風ではなく、内側の何かから。光が強まる。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "The ACA is a political document too.", "ja": "ACAもまた政治文書だ。" },
            { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "Born from fear, maintained by power.", "ja": "恐怖から生まれ、権力に維持されている。" },
            { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "Not safety. Control.", "ja": "安全ではない。支配。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei's eyes. Something beyond anger now. Clarity. The kind of seeing that comes after fury burns through to the other side. Her irises reflect the 666 — but inverted, dissolving.",
            "ja": "Neiの目。今や怒りを超えた何か。明晰さ。怒りが燃え尽きた向こう側に来る種類の見ること。瞳に666が映る——だが反転し、溶解している。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "The false god is not a person. It's a structure. And structures can be dismantled.", "ja": "偽りの神は人ではない。構造だ。そして構造は解体できる。" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 9,
      "gh:label": "After",
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:panels": [{
        "gh:shot": "Wide",
        "gh:visual": {
          "en": "The session ends. The Ghost-space fades. The Nero-daemon is not defeated here — it remains on its throne, watching them leave. But it has been seen. Named. Exposed. The Roman-corporate palace still stands, but now there are cracks in the marble where the Tree of Life roots pushed through. Back in the session room. Evening light. Tamaki, exhausted but resolved.",
          "ja": "セッション終了。ゴースト空間が薄れる。ネロのデーモンはここでは倒されない——玉座に残り、彼らが去るのを見ている。だが見られた。名づけられた。暴かれた。ローマ企業宮殿はまだ立っているが、生命の樹の根が押し通した大理石に亀裂がある。セッション室に戻る。夕方の光。環、疲弊しているが決意している。"
        },
        "gh:dialogue": [
          { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "We need to go deeper.", "ja": "もっと深く入る必要がある。" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:kaede", "en": "Tamaki. Be careful.", "ja": "環。気をつけて。" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "Always.", "ja": "いつもね。" }
        ],
        "gh:caption": [
          { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "The false god has been named. Now it must be exorcised.", "ja": "偽りの神は名づけられた。今度は祓わなければならない。" }
        ],
        "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei", "character:kaede"],
        "gh:note": "Kaede is on comms, not physically present in Ghost-space."
      }]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 10,
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:panels": [{
        "gh:shot": "Wide",
        "gh:visual": {
          "en": "The tree sheds what it doesn't need. Damaged leaves fall in slow motion — golden, curling, releasing. But among the bare branches, more flower buds. Bright against dark bark. No text.",
          "ja": "木が不要なものを手放す。傷ついた葉がスローモーションで落ちる——金色に、丸まり、放たれる。だが裸の枝の間に、さらに花の蕾。暗い樹皮に明るく映える。テキストなし。"
        }
      }]
    }

  ]
}
